---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="Plan a Trip | Talon Expeditions" description="Start planning a private group, active, trekking, learn-to, cultural or cruise trip with Talon Expeditions." image={images.lake}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.lake}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Start planning</p><h1 class="section-title">Tell us the trip you are trying to create.</h1><p>A destination is useful. A finished itinerary is not required. Start with the group, the experience, the timing, or even just the idea.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Talk with Talon</p><h2 class="section-title">The first conversation is about fit.</h2><p class="section-copy">We will use the basics to understand your group, what you want the trip to accomplish, and where Talon can help.</p><div class="contact-card"><strong>Email</strong><p><a href="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com">sales@talonexpeditions.com</a></p><strong>Service area</strong><p>U.S.-based planning with worldwide trip support.</p></div></div><form class="contact-form" action="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><div><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" required /></div><div><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required /></div><div><label for="group-type">Group type</label><select id="group-type" name="group-type"><option>Private group</option><option>Club or community</option><option>Business or team</option><option>Studio / wellness group</option><option>Individual / selected departure</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for="group-size">Approximate group size</label><input id="group-size" name="group-size" placeholder="For example, 12–18" /></div><div class="full"><label for="trip">What kind of trip are you considering?</label><input id="trip" name="trip" placeholder="Destination, activity, skill, or general idea" /></div><div class="full"><label for="message">What should we know?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you want the group to experience, timing, constraints, or anything else useful."></textarea></div><div class="full"><button class="button" type="submit">Start the Conversation</button></div></form></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
